        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pru Goward, Prudence Jane Goward\n- Places: Goulburn, Adelaide, New South Wales\n- Organizations: Liberal Party of Australia, Berejiklian government\n- Roles: Electoral district representative, Minister for Family and Community Services, Minister for Social Housing, Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault\n- Topics: Australian politics\n\nFacts:\n- Prudence Jane Goward was born on 2 September 1952 in Adelaide.\n- Pru Goward is an Australian politician.\n- Pru Goward has served as the New South Wales Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault since 2015.\n- Pru Goward has served as the New South Wales Minister for Family and Community Services and Minister for Social Housing since January 2017 in the Berejiklian government.\n- Pru Goward of the Liberal Party of Australia represents the electoral district of Goulburn.",
